<span id="S6.SS1.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32.92em;">
<span id="S6.SS1.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS1.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Answer to RQ1:<span id="S6.SS1.p4.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
EfficientUICoder effectively achieves 55%-60% image token compression and 56%-94% code redundancy reduction while maintaining or improving generation performance.</span></span></span>
